  "an10.187:1.1": "vo bhikkhave dhammaṃ desissāmi sukhudrayañ ca, ",
  "an10.187:1.2": "taṃ suṇātha . . . pe . . . 2. ",
  "an10.187:1.3": "Katamo ca bhikkhave dukkhudrayo dhammo? ",
  "an10.187:1.4": "Pāṇātipāto . . . pe . . . ",
  "an10.187:1.5": "micchādiṭṭhi. ",
  "an10.187:1.6": "Ayaṃ vuccati bhikkhave dukkhudrayo dhammo. 3. ",
  "an10.187:2.1": "Katamo ca bhikkhave sukhudrayo dhammo? ",
  "an10.187:2.2": "Pāṇātipātā veramaṇī . . . pe . . . ",
  "an10.187:2.3": "sammādiṭṭhi. ",
  "an10.187:2.4": "Ayaṃ vuccati bhikkhave sukhudrayo dhammo ti. 1. ",
  "an10.187:2.5": "Dukkhavipākañ ca "
